<title>NEW ZEALAND: Infratil net asset backing NZ$1.107/shr.</title>
<headline>Infratil net asset backing NZ$1.107/shr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Infrastructure and Utilities Ltd (Infratil) on Monday said that its net asset backing, undiluted for options, was NZ$1.107 per fully paid share as at September 30.</p>
<p>This value was calculated after taking into account the company's net income after tax and after deducting a provision for tax on unrealised gains on investments held by Infratil Securities Limited.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
